## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run Django test suite: `python manage.py test ai_features.tests`
- Run `python manage.py check` to verify configuration.

### Manual Verification
- Upload a PDF file with <= 10 pages and verify full extraction & chunking.
- Upload a PDF file with > 10 pages and verify only the first 5 and last 5 pages are extracted/chunked.
- Attempt to upload a non-PDF file (`.txt`, `.jpg`, `.md`) and verify validation error message is shown and upload is rejected.
